/* Bigorna Rooms: the Portuguese (Brazil) of the interface, read by tr() (idioma.js).
   exact: English text -> Portuguese. {n} stands for a number and “{q}” / "{q}" for a quoted name (kept as it is);
   in the Portuguese, {Q} is that quoted text translated too (the name of a trigger kind, for instance).
   patterns: [
    // generator and original maps
    [/^Room added: (.+)$/, 'Sala adicionada: $1'],
    [/^Archetypes saved: (\d+)$/, 'Arquétipos salvos: $1'],
    [/^Act (I|II) · side quest (\d+)$/, 'Ato $1 · missão secundária $2'],
    [/^Act (I|II) · quest (\d+)$/, 'Ato $1 · missão $2'],RegExp, replacement] for texts with names: $1 is kept as it is, $T1 is translated.
   Game terms follow the official Portuguese translation of Descent: Legends of the Dark (peça, subcamada, marcador,
   proeza, apetrecho, espólio…). No text of the game is copied here. */
